{"title":"Monster","artist":"Meg&Dia","sourceId":"reference:JFrAZiEVrq7stIuf834B","sourceHash":"dd358bee5d992c7fa6c828c4119c691755250f02c852dbd8956be4257fafe0e3","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":37052632,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":11.67,"end":17.06,"text":"His little whispers: Love me, love me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":17.06,"end":21.47,"text":"That's all I ask for: Love me, love me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":21.47,"end":31.67,"text":"He battered his tiny fists to feel something","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.67,"end":41.53,"text":"Wondered what it's like to touch and feel something","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":41.53,"end":44.0,"text":"Monster","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":44.0,"end":45.83,"text":"How should I feel?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":45.83,"end":48.3,"text":"Creatures lie here","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":48.3,"end":52.95,"text":"Looking through the windows","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":61.92,"end":66.93,"text":"That night he caged her, bruised and broke her","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":66.93,"end":72.14,"text":"He struggled closer, then he stole her","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":72.14,"end":77.03999999999999,"text":"Violette wrists and then her ankles","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":77.03999999999999,"end":81.81,"text":"Silent pain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":81.81,"end":90.76,"text":"Then he slowly saw their nightmares were his dreams","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":90.76,"end":92.28,"text":"Monster","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":92.28,"end":95.25999999999999,"text":"How should I feel?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":95.25999999999999,"end":97.39,"text":"Creatures lie here","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":97.39,"end":100.77000000000001,"text":"Looking through the window","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":100.77000000000001,"end":104.85,"text":"I will hear their voices","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":104.85,"end":107.47999999999999,"text":"I'm a glass child","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":107.47999999999999,"end":110.64,"text":"I am hannah's regrets","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":110.64,"end":136.12,"text":"Monster","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":136.12,"end":138.52,"text":"How should I feel?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":138.52,"end":140.98,"text":"Turn the sheets down","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":140.98,"end":144.37,"text":"Murder ears with pillow lace","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":144.37,"end":148.24,"text":"There's bath tubs full of glow flies","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":148.24,"end":151.06,"text":"Bathe in kerosene","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":151.06,"end":158.03,"text":"Their words tattooed in his veins","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}